of incredible adventures!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame features:\\u003cbr\\u003e● Original gameplay: make match-3 combinations and decorate your house while enjoying an exciting story!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Thousands of captivating levels with explosive power-ups, useful boosters, and cool elements.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Exciting events: embark on fascinating expeditions, compete against other players in different challenges, and win awesome prizes!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Unique rooms with original designs: from Austin\\u0026#39;s bedroom to a greenhouse.\\u003cbr\\u003e● Loads of fun characters: meet Austin\\u0026#39;s friends and your neighbors!\\u003cbr\\u003e● Adorable pets that will become your faithful companions!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with your Facebook friends, or make new friends in the game community!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHomescapes is free to play, but some in-game elements (including randomized items) can be purchased for real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Wi-Fi or internet connection is not required to play.\\u003cbr\\u003e *An internet connection is required to access competitions and additional features.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you like Homescapes? Follow us on social media!\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/homescapes\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.instagram.com/homescapes_mobile/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNeed to report an issue or ask a question? Contact Player Support through the game by going to Settings \\u0026gt; Help and Support. If you can\\u0026#39;t access the game, use the web chat by clicking the chat icon in the lower right corner of our website: https://playrix.helpshift.com/hc/en/14-homescapes/\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://playrix.com/privacy/index.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://playrix.com/terms/index.html\"],\"Playrix\",\"500.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/U7-71AFKFm6f4Ak4Z0NxL