Uopw7d9FQOVHuJpD0cntLOh_UcZC9-c2emm\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5ccus18OzxBzLMNPAyXuuW6fULV7bRacpk5_eIxPyCguqgSH36QGsvpAXM4Z1kqwalg1pVZgjIU6jzqSx5ODkA\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2PZJR7XjGopRCHsvOI8cIAxSKdSjZF-dFJVS5-X5IZj_WJ0dYs53YhV2MeGHsvsc6VW74DBfLdg2Je6Nws3Pq0s\"]],[null,2,[2736,1260],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VuUJBmJPXkTAmF87wz3z4t0ewaH5xes3Z0QkI5Dr7VqZeUHaB5Dz1cYkhT8r8eouHNVDX4PMzAQuG_BythZU\"]]],\"Haunted Merge: Horror Story\",[\"4,6\",4.6345177],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\"]],[\"qgJoGmYICkoTCK/Y2rDHkJcDFSKzrAIdF40jpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCPQohChtjb20ud2hhbGVqb3kuaG9ycm9yc3RvcnkuZ3AQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"IgTaB-tShew\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:IgTaB-tShew\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkbps_NelI20XVBazw3A-8LZ-bLDyDkjFSwLRAAmkykCkhuidil2Maqvv86qk0-2l8HN0YKP2rMbfd59GnHiF3TIauP7HmsViGW8C0QpSgKhx5R2dmfE50GllCjhCh-axHx_8iovODxTl3TbVLqi7Fv6n6E4h21kXFl26U-DJvWuWI0_n3MEkkW3BydAt-huPUfkqRnNTE9ilTdLZ9M3Gk_pak-DY9WOGaf2yUXluKYlNTIWar_qYcnOm43ELoxbelLBi_CGNnTk0MbElYyU38RskjmPCdGZ31PAVlmoBmurQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IgTaB-tShew/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u0026quot;You don\\u0026#39;t see them... but they see you.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’re an orphan, raised by a wandering feng shui master who found you near a graveyard. Before he died, he handed you a locked box—the only clue to your past. After burying him, you begin your journey to uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eYour first lead brings you to a run-down apartment building. You move in as a tenant—but something is deeply wrong.\\u003cbr\\u003e- The elevator opens by itself—on floors no one pressed.\\u003cbr\\u003e- An empty unit echoes with whispers that don’t exist.\\u003cbr\\u003e- A cursed construction site keeps taking lives...\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat starts as a ghost story becomes something far more disturbing.\\u003cbr\\u003eBecause sometimes, the real horror isn’t the ghost—it’s the people.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eFace your fears and uncover long-buried secrets\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge clues to reveal hidden truths\\u003cbr\\u003eLook closely - every detail could crack the case\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve puzzles and relax through a hauntingly original experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDare to look deeper?\\u003cbr\\u003eYour parents are gone. But why?\\u003cbr\\u003eIs it a curse… or a cover-up?\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you tell what’s real - and what’s a setup?\\u003cbr\\u003eThe deaths keep coming. Accidents? Or something worse?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for players who:\\u003cbr\\u003eLove creepy folktales and chilling mysteries\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy merge mechanics with a twist\\u003cbr\\u003eAre drawn to stories about the dark side of human nature\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is your only way out.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Haunted Merge: Horror Story\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge the evidence. Uncover the truth.\\u003cbr\\u003eExpose the terrifying secrets buried behind every story they tried to erase.\\u0026quot;\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFacebook:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/HauntedMergeGames\"],\"WhaleJoy Game Limited\",\"1.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0J-mq5H4QCThfEQvEoKHXaxMMob0O6a0FxJfT5WvqXTbBLOtZwwhmy3eewvCOJkmznnuykYnYu424DPKBYUq5w\"],null,[18,20,18,255]],null,[\"Rating 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Horor\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.whalejoy.horrorstory.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"Rp 9.500 - Rp 1.590.000 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Kasual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.infiniplay.merge.fashion.romance.story\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RBJQHS4LrfB2YsanJQcGbFkV1O4kdt_6x3yFZHf8o_UnSM20e5siDSc7tVc3uvE7_A_9JA0RbZiPfHwor02Ut44\"],null,[229,115,255,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sqLwP7qygS7zLgQVGuELTaTDCtjs8gkT6n6KfVpAOlZIb86sCtQSgCfPqnQPu96i3Y96wJan_lzLZ_jvvx_cFEc\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7hZeezBaTxsR6ukOFdStLJvVGsx6AwpdYt-bWykBYdd8czY0vMj_pSPjO0qioHtP5bbytHOa1X1KH93VggcL\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[nu