details?id\\u003dcom.infiniplay.merge.fashion.romance.story\"]],[\"qgJ/Gn0IC0oTCK/Y2rDHkJcDFSKzrAIdF40jpfoBFAoSCOPKg6eq1rCOQxIGCgJpZBAAugJMCjAKKmNvbS5pbmZpbmlwbGF5Lm1lcmdlLmZhc2hpb24ucm9tYW5jZS5zdG9yeRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"ivBQcPKIRVM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:ivBQcPKIRVM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:ivBQcPKIRVM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznR7WcdJdN2nfua_xiq_ryh4ton0TAXx5BXn0mBtLsaMXFCULlKLE6wla4eDIG8LLrz3IwcZ9kYGBDDA5zaIEP1WLGnbrU0lCIS-veyh0XQ8zMjM6Aggcf-oZ-QLOPEy7ld-xQ3vRgY7pYTksYKUVlBDvxiKdeN2DAJyLr3_2iHUzV6NgHlWSrXxOjYwt3oIRcK9RSpD0wWSlxZcNGr7Hql88iEGgmmEeqMmhI_FoIemQX_FhmB0JsaSR0BRBR9i9KbSJMMmrrUX5Xp-0c28IAzhM8HPKtpu6yBWPz-aZFG_g\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ivBQcPKIRVM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Merge Fashion: Romance Story Game ✨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSelamat datang di Merge Fashion: Romance Story Game, sebuah game simulasi kasual yang memadukan fashion merge, makeover, puzzle, dan romance story interaktif dalam satu pengalaman bermain yang penuh warna. Di sini, setiap keputusan, setiap merge item, dan setiap makeover akan memengaruhi perjalanan cerita yang Anda jalani bersama karakter utama.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌸 Kisah Utama: Perjalanan Alice\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIkuti kisah Alice, seorang gadis muda yang hidupnya berubah setelah pengkhianatan yang menyakitkan. Dari titik terendah, ia memilih untuk bangkit, membangun identitas baru, dan menemukan kembali kepercayaan diri.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDalam dunia merge story, Anda membantu Alice melewati bab-bab kehidupan yang penuh drama, cinta, konflik, dan misteri. Setiap chapter menghadirkan alur romance story interaktif, di mana pilihan Anda menentukan hubungan, konflik, dan akhir cerita.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eApakah Alice akan menemukan cinta sejatinya, atau justru mengungkap rahasia besar yang mengubah segalanya?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💄 Makeover \\u0026amp; Game Make Up\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRasakan pengalaman makeover game yang kreatif dan santai. Anda berperan langsung dalam transformasi Alice.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGunakan berbagai item dalam game make up untuk menciptakan tampilan glamor atau natural\\u003cbr\\u003eLakukan eksperimen gaya dalam game makeover\\u003cbr\\u003eBuka riasan dan aksesori baru seiring progres\\u003cbr\\u003eSesuaikan wajah, rambut, dan gaya sesuai kreativitas Anda\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSetiap perubahan tidak hanya mengubah tampilan, tetapi juga membuka jalur cerita baru dalam dunia romance fashion story.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👗 Fashion Merge \\u0026amp; Dress Up\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMasuki dunia fashion merge game dengan koleksi item yang beragam dan menarik. Gabungkan item sederhana menjadi sesuatu yang lebih eksklusif.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFitur utama:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔗 Merge Items: Combine clothes, Flowser, and accessories\\u003cbr\\u003e👠 Dress Up: Ciptakan outfit terbaik sesuai gaya Anda\\u003cbr\\u003e💎 Rare Items: Buka item langka melalui progres cerita\\u003cbr\\u003e🎀 Style Growth: Kembangkan gaya Alice dari sederhana menjadi fashion icon\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSetiap outfit akan memengaruhi bagaimana karakter lain melihat Alice dalam perjalanan fashion romance story game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔮 Puzzle \\u0026amp; Story Progress\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame ini bukan hanya dress up, tetapi juga kombinasi merge puzzle dan story progression.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAnda akan:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMenyelesaikan puzzle untuk membuka item baru\\u003cbr\\u003eMengumpulkan resource untuk upgrade makeover\\u003cbr\\u003eMembuka chapter cerita baru\\u003cbr\\u003eMembuat pilihan penting dalam alur romance story\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSemakin jauh bermain, semakin kompleks cerita yang terbuka, dengan lebih banyak kejutan, konflik, dan hubungan emosional.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Romance Story Interaktif\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCinta adalah inti dari perjalanan ini.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBertemu karakter dengan kepribadian berbeda\\u003cbr\\u003eMembangun hubungan melalui pilihan cerita\\u003cbr\\u003eMengungkap rahasia masa lalu\\u003cbr\\u003eMenentukan akhir dari romance merge story\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSetiap keputusan membawa konsekuensi yang memengaruhi hubungan, fashion journey, dan masa depan Alice.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Fitur Utama\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Kombinasi merge, fashion, makeover, puzzle, dan romance story\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Cerita interaktif dengan banyak ending\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Kustomisasi outfit dan makeup tanpa batas\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Event dan chapter baru secara berkala\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Gameplay santai, cocok dimainkan kapan saja\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎀 Untuk Pecinta Fashion \\u0026amp; Story Game\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame ini cocok untuk pemain yang menyukai:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame fashion dan dress up\\u003cbr\\u003eGame makeover dan make up\\u003cbr\\u003eGame cerita romantis\\u003cbr\\u003ePuzzle merge ringan dan adiktif\\u003cbr\\u003eSimulasi karakter perempuan\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Bangun Dunia Fashion Anda\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDi Merge Fashion: Romance Story Game, Anda bukan hanya pemain, tetapi juga stylist dan penentu jalan cerita.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBantu Alice berkembang, bentuk gaya fashion terbaik, dan tentukan kisah cintanya sendiri.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSetiap merge, setiap makeover, dan setiap pilihan membawa Anda lebih dekat ke akhir cerita yang unik.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Mulai sekarang dan masuki dunia Merge Fashion, tempat fashion, cinta, dan misteri berpadu dalam satu pengalaman game yang penuh emosi dan kreativitas.\"],\"Infiniplay-Game\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DJMQF1xCXfV3yeVkJH-aXYRMO9k0TrwUzOoJJGTykes8oAPikpteMJg3rP7bHPosJEtwnRyccExvuzNq4TpA\"],null,[240,227,202,255]],null,[\"Rating 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Sindiran Seksual\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.infiniplay.merge.fashion.romance.story\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.infiniplay.merge.fashion.romance.story\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"Rp 4.900 - Rp 1.990.000 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Kasual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.fortune.ocean.game\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/T8Okjo-FZZJC1xEhgQTgvZrAoUcaPpokocQPOn0g7nwIOqJM5NOeVFvZpdm5ycY4Ua9Ar3OMBYlp9OTaOUGLew\"],null,[55,56,224,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EBnPrjiJ4a4sB9Oinf_NO6cmRRCti0RA-cwcyr3dRZFV1Dx5N7DPCRe2OJ7ivJUPwBFjkTuPHNjpIpr_TNA0tA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7-Nun-jR4ruNEqTFAaiG35d2YIPo9jSl2Hwd0Zk_y54piD7oNg7vXY-Dh_RgJ6rSzGdY0nzjJ0OiIf45wiInDg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8WE2IgDmjSdGhKYsZuwOgHzsC4bZVSddGriaNSIcMZmTkq-SC9wj23WABu4OtK-rdYX-g25zsdP9wnL5hRE1\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kgQRAnstB6vUUeT-eu004rB9zrMmtVQcZvz0CcxLOzHhXJo0CGhcm4864S4YY_ouKJGMo5S9fniatlgR45rN\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bYh_BpmyDhlWjZrgPX0y1GEL-2DwSjOTH5fpc5y7-ZljjDX--i1tnJIsV1t4jkLPkCP2nsokuSBj0uXBmwL7rA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QbMX3TnZ0HkmgkZK2avt8Yx2uAOQmXUiq3Ygfef1flXFFbUh3OcZFx2gRChHJvZSy7uIyif-rNzeamJlQax3U1E\"]]],\"Fortune Ocean\",[\"3,6\",3.62],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fortune.ocean.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fortune.ocean.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fortune.ocean.game\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIDEoTCK/Y2rDHkJcDFSKzrAIdF40jpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCOAocChZjb20uZm9ydHVuZS5vY2Vhbi5nYW1lEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Embark on an unforgettable undersea adventure with Fortune Ocean, the captivating mobile fishing game that brings the thrill of the ocean right to your fingertips. Designed for fishing enthusiasts and casual gamers alike, Fortune Ocean immerses players in a vibrant and visually stunning underwater world filled with a diverse array of colorful fish species, each with its own unique charm and value.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom the moment you dive into the game, you\\u0026#39;ll be greeted by stunning graphics that showcase the beauty and mystique of the deep blue sea. The intuitive touch controls make it easy to navigate your fishing boat and cast your line, allowing you to quickly become a master angler. With a variety of weapons and upgrades available, you can customize your fishing experience and take on bigger, more challenging catches.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBut Fortune Ocean isn\\u0026#39;t just about catching fish; it\\u0026#39;s also about accumulating wealth and treasures. As you progress through the game, you\\u0026#39;ll have the opportunity to collect coins, gems, and other valuable items that can be used to purchase new equipment, upgrade your boat, and unlock special abilities. With each successful catch, you\\u0026#39;ll earn rewards and climb up the leaderboards, competing with players from around the world to see who can become the top fisherman.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat sets Fortune Ocean apart from other fishing games is its attention to detail and commitment to player engagement. The game features a rich storyline that unfolds as you progress, introducing new characters, challenges, and locations that keep the gameplay fresh and exciting. Plus, with regular updates and new content added, you\\u0026#39;ll never run out of things to do in this vast and ever-evolving underwater world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re a seasoned angler or just looking for a fun and relaxing way to pass the time, Fortune Ocean is the perfect mobile game for you. So grab your fishing gear, set sail, and see what treasures await you in the depths of the ocean.\"],\"hizWeb\",\"100.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PK4Mqnqm9m16jLoeH_4tMQ9lx60Ysv9gXQihH9bNWahglQwcrA9TLP4euGE4P1Fo9nBRfs_77y7x9eRqpSd-lQ\"],null,[59,79,173,255]],null,[\"Rating 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Gambar Perjudian yang Jelas\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\