ull,\"AXH1ezl6HMhAha-dqqUDmknBoqhLHZ_gZyNiKQbGyGunczy9NtlVRQg1pxV3anL_eI3kgOO1vh63Z2Bp-axQyCxMQ2LjyR-Y2fU96ikkV_pDFNmLnhd6eMkSpVHr_1JHalUVCKN0KZ8Re0t5UX8bV3AIIUHYuvEKLjT5M7DLe-8FufEtL0N3DKmT02CpB1GRM6yCQ9i3Jo-i7Efpx5CgYGRjkWEuY_noVv9BH3TOj_97LgCyljXcV79002sna7BHT5ext0ZOspZStHK9ryXFr9iuVVFCaYlAqu-OnndIdrj0cEuYIA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1TepgKOEBaw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Get ready to embrace the glamorous world of Glow Fashion Idol! Step into the spotlight and unleash your inner fashion stylist in this dazzling dress up and makeover story. As a talented fashion stylist in the fashion industry, you will create breathtaking outfits and showcase your makeover skills in the makeover studio.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the exhilarating fashion battle where you\\u0026#39;ll compete with other girls to become the super stylist of the fashion show. Mix and match various outfits, experiment with makeup styles in the makeup studio, and design unique fashion design pieces to climb the ranks and earn the glam title of Fashion Idol.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eImmerse yourself in the captivating fashion story, where you\\u0026#39;ll encounter exciting challenges, inspiring fashion shows, and a chance to transform into a true fashion idol and super stylist. Express your creativity by putting together incredible glam outfits, each telling a mesmerizing makeover story.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith a wide variety of designer outfits and accessories at your fingertips, this dress up game will provide endless possibilities to style and customize your model. Show off your impeccable taste in fashion, dress up in stunning outfits, and let your creativity shine!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026gt; Dress up your virtual model girls with an extensive wardrobe collection filled with glam outfits.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026gt; Unlock makeup styles and hairstyles to create a signature look in the makeup studio.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026gt; Compete in the fashion battle to prove your fashion stylist expertise.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026gt; Embark on an exciting fashion story filled with captivating challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026gt; Showcase your fashion design skills and create bespoke pieces for the runway.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026gt; Participate in the fashion show to gain recognition as the Glow Fashion Idol.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u0026gt; Unleash your inner makeover guru in the makeover studio, turning ordinary girls into extraordinary.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGlow Fashion Idol is not just a makeover story, but a journey into the glitzy and chic world of fashion. Are you ready to become the ultimate Glow Fashion Idol? Play now and start your fashion adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e*In-App purchases may include random items.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTo opt out of CrazyLabs sales of personal information as a California resident, please visit the settings page within this app. For more information visit our privacy policy: https://crazylabs.com/app\"],\"CrazyLabs LTD\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Rp9DnjDDvr3OVlSBI4bALd1OlSb700suLIwW34GpZBlc5mON-klkIaZoThITumKFuVSeB4Iz0QNw6omdSRk4\"],null,[18,16,17,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Pembelian Dalam Game\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,