y-lh.googleusercontent.com/CqsFWxthgnqScqxVaTr2ODkX1A2kBEcJhfKC_BLddVagC8g2FCJtgyKXUng5sQ0t8QSV__ohwWkkjvIuHatQ_g\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ufkxldQ0UEXex4HSyxJ0o9Saaw53OXs9v2UqDzCGm3JHxUSyEXqL6SorDiZGeGT_eA0jlLgl0M7Z9UJZdWgZ\"]]],\"Crazy Fox\",[\"4,4\",4.386076],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gworld.crazyspin\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gworld.crazyspin\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gworld.crazyspin\"]],[\"qgJhGl8ILUoTCK/Y2rDHkJcDFSKzrAIdF40jpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCNgoaChRjb20uZ3dvcmxkLmNyYXp5c3BpbhABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"yj8wgjPMIRM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:yj8wgjPMIRM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:yj8wgjPMIRM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezn3iJrwfYiq5RZf9ORlMOEO9GNDP2E3WfLXMSybXxsxaRXHShgTT9lsZnd837rR2Szi7upidkP1BcAbRfJSfV0WqmvsmEyORHA28tEzHL_btnIdFykp9JVXGik6h5q9VVjyejB40v6cOMz_wOBOKCwtHI2VSXUgeEbx5WI-UObbfbBZpso3PdEAuNVR0ddiBXkgMTOeoM9w2wApYJTgYHT7o2KjtiB6-E3GHNmVnKcEBUpCwpvPfjB2YQA50JE4IMUPFlFduHip5UdV9fIRBDdnoAGgxsSc3E61Aw-52_iDoA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yj8wgjPMIRM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u0026quot;Jump into Crazy Fox — a feel-good spin, raid and build adventure where every turn holds a surprise.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTeam up with your clever Fox crew and race through 600+ magical villages. Spin for coins and shields, raid rivals for loot, collect cards and pets, and upgrade faster as you go. Easy to learn, hard to put down — one spin can change everything.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSpin and win\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery spin brings coins, shields, raids — or the unexpected. From big moments to last-second saves, each turn delivers a quick burst of excitement.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmart raids\\u003cbr\\u003eRivals took your loot? Hit back. Raid their vaults, shake up their villages, and grab the gold you need to power your next upgrade.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBuild your village\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom candy kingdoms to jungle hideouts, unlock and upgrade over 600 fantasy villages. Build faster, grow bigger, and make every stop on the map your favorite.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCards and pets\\u003cbr\\u003eHunt down rare cards, complete themed albums, and bond with adorable pets that boost your rewards and defense as you climb.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClimb ranks\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin time-limited events, chase leaderboards, and pick up daily bonuses and challenges. The higher you go, the bigger the rewards — and the brighter your Fox story shines.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay with friends\\u003cbr\\u003eTrade cards, send gifts, and team up for co-op events. Whether you’re here for a quick break or a long run, there’s always something waiting.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy players love it\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fast, satisfying spin, raid and build gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• 600+ villages to unlock and upgrade\\u003cbr\\u003e• Competitive events and deep card collection\\u003cbr\\u003e• Adorable pets and playful visuals\\u003cbr\\u003e• Regular updates packed with surprises\\u003cbr\\u003e• Social features you can enjoy with friends\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSupport: support@astakplay.com\\u003cbr\\u003eWebsite: https://crazyfoxgame.com\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://www.astakplay.com/privacy.html\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use: https://www.astakplay.com/policy.html\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCrazy Fox is free to play with optional in-app purchases. For players aged 18+. Internet connection required.\\u0026quot;\"],\"ASTAK TECH\",\"5.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,