GNBu8y26C72L-ZWOZ4RF1c1Nzlj2dn9Q\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JnlRwXpFu_K-DklPKtmgBnYl2dIQ3YEpmN0b6Jz1ndVLgVG7zxcj1UkwJKysbUoWWku4Po0gPH2orxwKgiUjLac\"]]],\"Eggy Party: Trendy Party Game\",[\"4,2\",4.1904902],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.netease.partyglobal\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.netease.partyglobal\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.netease.partyglobal\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIQkoTCK/Y2rDHkJcDFSKzrAIdF40jpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQALoCOQodChdjb20ubmV0ZWFzZS5wYXJ0eWdsb2JhbBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"PnM0c0mfh1E\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:PnM0c0mfh1E?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:PnM0c0mfh1E\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmqOZazRvV3VD8YtGcVxTQC-j7DQKD8R7ciCItEo2RrOngJzIAAkfyhM1mtuTbr8GjWPhYGPojSSso7cISptZ_cTARfmBzmeoPVwnkBXnt7b1YND1AnQOb9DPcyxckjsOaGLCPU8zerhX1jW1ME5uJU8i8paPf1ukE-DtxGEl0nW-iqEHgRnKEPeWkStMbolXOP87FMhJo19Mf8EMATHOYZF25DCmA88FNcWV_2JXuSx-5asNLVw1W41qyym1ij_Ii1fXi6q5YLV23m3mxeeRALKU4z5mrnvTCmFnvdtSx6Qw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PnM0c0mfh1E/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"[Pengenalan Game]\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSelamat datang di game pesta kasual yang sangat populer, Eggy Party, yang dikembangkan oleh NetEase Games. Ayo pergi bersama para Eggy Partner ke Pulau Eggy untuk berpesta pora!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e[Fitur Game]\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAjak Temanmu Berpesta Pora\\u003cbr\\u003eSaatnya berpesta! Di sini, kamu bisa menemukan banyak Eggy yang imut dan menggemaskan, bersama-sama menikmati pemandangan Pulau Eggy dari bianglala raksasa, menaiki pesawat jet kecil, dan memainkan berbagai macam wahana seperti trampolin elastis dan piano lantai. Mari berpesta bersama!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMasuk ke EGGYVERSE dan Populerkan Gayamu\\u003cbr\\u003eSelamat datang di EGGYVERSE! Ini adalah dunia yang trendi, tempat kamu bisa bertemu dengan teman-teman yang modis dengan berbagai gaya seperti binatang, fantasi, imut... Beragam gaya yang melimpah dapat dipadukan sesukamu. Ayo populerkan gaya trendimu!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJelajahi Pulau Eggy dan Temukan Sobatmu\\u003cbr\\u003eIkuti berbagai party, seru-seruan dan berpelukanlah bersama teman-teman dalam game! Jangan lupa untuk tetap berhati-hati dengan berbagai rintangan dan hindari Eggy lainnya! Pesta ini bisa membuatmu ketagihan untuk berseru-seruan sepanjang hari!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTaman Bermain\\u003cbr\\u003ePenuh Warna dan Keseruan\\u003cbr\\u003eSelamat datang di Taman Bermain Pulau Eggy yang penuh warna! Di sini kamu bebas bermain dan merasakan keseruan seperti memperkuat skill, menaklukkan peta penuh tantangan sendiri atau bersama teman! Rasakan keseruan dengan meloloskan diri dari rintangan yang menegangkan, tapi bukan itu aja lho! Selain itu kamu bisa mengembangkan kreativitas dengan membuat petamu sendiri. Ayo petualangan hebat ini menantimu!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDapatkan informasi Eggy Party lainnya dengan mengikuti:\\u003cbr\\u003e· Situs Web Resmi: https://www.eggyparty.com/\\u003cbr\\u003e· Twitter: https://twitter.com/eggypartyglobal\\u003cbr\\u003e· YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCK0y3Dls7q62xvKyiHLvUeA\\u003cbr\\u003e· Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Eggy-Party-104857129058479\\u003cbr\\u003e· Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/eggypartyglobal/\\u003cbr\\u003e· TikTok: @eggypartysea2023\\u003cbr\\u003e· Discord: https://discord.gg/eggyparty\"],\"Exptional Global\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/U09H4AOtiJd47M4aTZwPr_61o88XGWLT2S2qA9EjBtkQWYBt0CMDkh7CzQO6gSNAxRKxdmNiP16uE5gJ_QuoVw\"],null,[89,195,238,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Interaksi Pengguna, Pembelian Dalam Game\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.netease.partyglobal\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.netease.partyglobal\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Instal\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"Rp 1.182 - Rp 1.399.000 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Kasual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.olleyo.piggy.king.free\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fQwjdPKTG8GzZjwuXN-zWJXbvpu8iTyrW2lYmzumnQn6BLhsuucYakh6lW9otaOwJ2LuJWylwA-8mJKfeQeV\"],null,[122,40,230,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JijAwZexIxTL6U-XRzB8RmlWNo0r2m5n7Sd7qHV7K0tDyFRx1r3ieaIS9JM2vDdUag8cgA1cDzKXxhEUav0t\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mIw9vuofceiQpXdamQux9buY1m3QEFfNB9usw5N8QObPJwsf3_O5Yw_HlFo0jcO-QgCE6cmUUSOGAxWnNT3YubU\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bU8wA-2ZHpvhGHj_xYrHah5v-P2Zlx1jYVjxDo1RENqHmhd5ZdKEj3GdPoIFi-ljHOXVbgyBZmX3CFTv8ZHRISI\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vCrXfsqi3baiBJ1LEY1TlfTsvTIj3joy7oJpYKEl03K455zkJucuA_up_3-dAK5Vrs8C01_FBYsN9MZkO7HGAg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QRk8EbOde7AdtX_E2AOZCSgP4JVYo_uStEWJeHBZk-YCq58X3VrQBubrXNYYHXah6BtUoblnZJYN4ruiyKJPlA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9tXmdfKIoB-suKf89y7uvnDESSQgsbrdGU3C0Y3IS8JO0c0kCnRYh-K0z1IYD8AVY3NnWoRHaCoTj-tQXykQeA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i4CuyVvODa0ohXbuMrp58grjrXtyUwUqwtGhoAGBl14RvtIxscHslqs-5Za_wxfl5COlB2PgJ6ZcDZJhwyTSENc\"]]],\"Piggy Kingdom\",[\"4,8\",4.8242426],\"Kasual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Beli\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.olleyo.piggy.king.free\"]],[\"qgJnGmUIQ0oTCK/Y2rDHkJcDFSKzrAIdF40jpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCPAogChpjb20ub2xsZXlvLnBpZ2d5LmtpbmcuZnJlZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Jingle-jingle, get your match 3 games - Piggy Kingdom ready to solve puzzles and get rewards. Match 3 games will leave happy emotions afterward. Piggy Kingdom will take you on an exciting journey where you will:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Solve puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Match, swap and crush colors\\u003cbr\\u003e• Get tons of unique boosters\\u003cbr\\u003e• Rich rewards - accumulate points and exchange them for in-game goods\\u003cbr\\u003e• Hundreds of challenging, chilling, and funny levels\\u003cbr\\u003e• Beautiful animations, cheerful music\\u003cbr\\u003e• Lots of ways to kill time with fun and joy\\u003cbr\\u003e• Easy to play and win! Here is where we all feel fine!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIT IS NOT A WASTE OF TIME. Challenging yet enjoyable match 3 puzzle games where you need to train your brain by swiping colorful objects in shapes of three or more. It just sounds to be so easy.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSMILE AS YOU WATCH YOUR BOOSTERS DOING MAGIC. Every time you wisely move sweet colorful pieces together – the puzzle game will give you unique powerful boosters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEVERY ATTEMPT IS APPRECIATED. Get rewards. Use accumulated boosters to finish a hard puzzle-solving game or keep them for the updated levels ahead.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEYE CANDY GRAPHICS + VISUALS. Your Piggy Kingdom game has never been so real. Boosters, puzzles, characters, surroundings, everything in this game looks so delightful.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eWhen you see the board which you need to clear – things look so real. Some of them you even may find at home around you in real life. The puzzle solving \\u0026amp; color swiping match 3 game is here for you! Piggy Kingdom is waiting for you!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePIGGY AND THE CASTLE. The character\\u0026#39;s reactions are so funny to look at, and the castle has so many details to give a closer look at.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFROM BEGINNERS TO PROS! Your level of playing and solving match puzzle games can be different, but be sure, you will enjoy this match 3 game.\"],\"olleyo\",\"1.000.000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BxWKHbbH7S2xDPAiu8aiiyurdUDvcjTD7w5LftCpe9yjWw4bulE6da3r62uBFYvKlB88rar_Gcuwn4yJr7rmag\"],null,[247,232,210,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"