YW5kLmltaS5oY3cQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Something huge is crawling underneath.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA Crazy Wiggler has appeared — and it’s up to your heroes to stop it.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHeroes vs Crazy Wiggler is a fast-paced casual survivor game where multiple heroes fight together against one massive, wiggling monster.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo complicated controls. No long grind. Just pure chaotic fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJump in, build your squad, and melt the boss.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️Easy to Play, Hard to Stop\\u003cbr\\u003eHeroes attack automatically\\u003cbr\\u003eJust move, dodge, and choose upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003eOne-hand friendly gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for quick sessions \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧬Survivor + Roguelike Upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003eRandom skills every match\\u003cbr\\u003eStack wild power-ups\\u003cbr\\u003eBreak the damage numbers\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery run feels different\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👥Build Your Hero Squad\\u003cbr\\u003eMultiple heroes fighting at the same time\\u003cbr\\u003eMix different skills \\u0026amp; roles\\u003cbr\\u003eTanks, shooters, casters, splash damage and more\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate crazy combos every run\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐛One Giant Enemy. Total Chaos.\\u003cbr\\u003eBattle a massive crawling Wiggler\\u003cbr\\u003eSmash segments, dodge attacks, survive waves\\u003cbr\\u003eFast, satisfying, non-stop action\"],\"IMIYOO\",\"100.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FQJDQygLbmuVzG9jXccFX4ClKLGBsP23tUIACFObkWYoBdA7GjBMmS2evypEh1WxApmJlLcljB3et3oYVQR4\"],null,[20,25,46,255]],null,[\"Rating 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Kekerasan Ringan\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/g