ps/details?id\\u003dcom.abstractsoft.animalsmash\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.abstractsoft.animalsmash\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.abstractsoft.animalsmash\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIV0oTCK/Y2rDHkJcDFSKzrAIdF40jpfoBDAoKCAASBgoCaWQQAboCPgoiChxjb20uYWJzdHJhY3Rzb2Z0LmFuaW1hbHNtYXNoEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"F01tpLJdxxo\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:F01tpLJdxxo?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:F01tpLJdxxo\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlSev3pTxAqJVz_Vbmg6AL5rYAcZbh6x1Tw-69MpdEMFun841k0x9aGbxawJOvOTmkiYL-fAebc4rAKYPN0gU33KfULr_2_-MjTk-x0MeN0ldDf0tdGb0LiHgIHzKT-wE8hmzUch65Rgjql60ja4LADadlizjEsFtr9qh8HR8sgCCR7Ur3a5oJa3yIiG1gVJ0t4eAU23earwX-dX5Qe8tYNfEzUR1pnTRCgACZyPZdW_uybAal3E9voCBQlqHbIfMz23drXdOW8PB-a9f72cfrdzcKIT1NTHFwEQUgmY4YQwA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/F01tpLJdxxo/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Unleash your imagination in Animash, the ultimate animal fusion and battle arena game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat happens when you combine a wolf with a dragon? Create your own one-of-a-kind creature in this advanced AI monster maker. With seemingly endless combinations at your fingertips, you can build the ultimate team of hybrid beasts and prove you\\u0026#39;re the greatest fusion master in the world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e - 🐉 Epic Animal Fusions: Use our advanced AI to fuse two animals and generate a unique hybrid creature. Mix animals to discover custom appearances, powers, and stats. The ultimate animal mashup awaits!\\u003cbr\\u003e - ⚔️ Arena Battles: Take your creations into the battle arena! Test your creatures\\u0026#39; strength in action-packed battles. Level up your beasts, unlock powerful new skills, and challenge friends to duels.\\u003cbr\\u003e - 🏆 Collect \\u0026amp; Progress: Become a legendary creature collector! Earn achievements for creating rare and powerful hybrids. Discover high-star powerhouses to climb the leaderboard and dominate the arena.\\u003cbr\\u003e - 📜 Custom Creature Lore: Every new animal fusion comes with its own story! Discover your creature\\u0026#39;s temperament, favorite food, and hidden powers that come alive in battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e - 📓 Document Your Discoveries: Your fusion journal tracks every creature you create. Collect, compare, and show off your most powerful or bizarre animal hybrids to your friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e - ⏳ Fresh Challenges Daily: New animals rotate every 3 hours, giving you fresh possibilities for your next epic fusion. Unlock special reward animals and keep them in your collection permanently!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReady to bring your creations to life? Download Animash now and start building your unimaginable beast army today!\"],\"Abstract Software Inc.\",\"10.000.000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/msUPvyOTuUKKEzVSlTcMhh5r0hb4VxtrVOJxJB414RFXmtERmY26l6m-0ZXDS8TMnvX-OUJ0G9-WYVYUj8F7gg\"],null,[251,251,250,255]],null,[\"Rating 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003ePelajari lebih lanjut\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Cocok untuk semua kelompok usia. Beberapa kekerasan dalam konteks komikal atau fantasi dapat diterima. Bahasa kasar tidak diizinkan.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"IDR\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"